Diorama game test shim

The interfaces in net.fabricmc.fabric.api.client.gametest.v1 are derived from Fabric API's
fabric-client-gametest-api-v1 module for Minecraft 1.21.4, and parts of dev.diorama.gameshim
(the window, input, world creation and game option handling) are adapted from that module's
implementation. Both were trimmed and changed to run Diorama's client game tests on Minecraft
versions before 1.21.4.

